%% Flow - special question to versioned answer page
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant User as Question Author
  participant GH as GitHub
  participant CI as Actions Generate Pipeline
  participant Cls as Classifier
  participant Ret as Retrieval Level 1
  participant Ctr as Contract and Prompt Selection
  participant Rt as Model Router
  participant AI as AI Provider
  participant Val as Citation and Mermaid Validators
  participant Rev as Reviewer
  participant Site as Published Site

  User->>GH: submit question via workflow dispatch or issue
  GH->>CI: trigger question pipeline
  CI->>Cls: classify question type and scope
  Cls-->>CI: task type label
  CI->>Ret: deterministic file selection
  Ret->>Ret: contract files plus frontmatter closure plus grep
  Ret-->>CI: evidence bundle
  CI->>Ctr: select contract and prompt template
  Ctr-->>CI: contract with output schema and gates
  CI->>Rt: route by task policy
  Rt->>AI: completion call with delimited evidence
  AI-->>Rt: draft answer page
  Rt-->>CI: parsed draft
  CI->>Val: validate citations against evidence and compile mermaid
  Val-->>CI: pass or fail report
  CI->>GH: open preview PR on docs-gen branch
  GH->>Rev: request approval
  Rev->>GH: approve and merge
  GH->>Site: build publishes versioned answer page
